<title>USA: U.S. CREDIT OUTLOOK-CPI, other data week's focus.</title>
<headline>U.S. CREDIT OUTLOOK-CPI, other data week's focus.</headline>
<byline>John P. Hughes</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Traders of U.S. government securities expect to have a busy week on their hands following Friday's bloodbath in the bond market.</p>
<p>Several important economic releases scheduled include U.S. consumer prices on Tuesday, business inventories on Wednesday and industrial production and capacity utilization on Friday.</p>
